<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" data-theme="default">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About - Starving Artists</title>
  
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/variables.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/themes/default.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/overrides.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/layout.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/components.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="app-header">
    <div class="container">
      <a href="/" class="app-logo">🎨 <span>Starving Artists</span></a>
      <nav class="header-nav">
        <a href="/" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary">Home</a>
        <a href="/rules" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary">Rules</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="app-main">
    <div class="container py-5">
      <h1 class="display-4 mb-4">About Starving Artists</h1>
      
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-8">
          <div class="card mb-4">
            <div class="card-body">
              <h2 class="h4 mb-3">🎨 The Game</h2>
              <p>
                Starving Artists is a competitive board game where players take on the role of struggling artists 
                trying to create masterpieces while managing their limited resources and nutrition.
              </p>
              <p>
                This online version brings the tabletop experience to your browser, allowing you to play with 
                friends from anywhere in the world in real-time!
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card mb-4">
            <div class="card-body">
              <h2 class="h4 mb-3">🎲 Original Board Game</h2>
              <p>
                Starving Artists was originally designed as a physical board game by 
                <strong>Fairway 3 Games, LLC</strong>.
              </p>
              <p>
                If you enjoy this online adaptation, consider supporting the creators by purchasing the 
                physical version!
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card mb-4">
            <div class="card-body">
              <h2 class="h4 mb-3">💻 Online Adaptation</h2>
              <p>Features of this online version:</p>
              <ul>
                <li><strong>Real-time multiplayer</strong> - Play with 2-4 players simultaneously</li>
                <li><strong>Drag-and-drop painting</strong> - Intuitive interface for painting canvases</li>
                <li><strong>Instant updates</strong> - See other players' moves in real-time</li>
                <li><strong>No installation required</strong> - Play directly in your browser</li>
                <li><strong>Mobile-friendly</strong> - Responsive design works on any device</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="card mb-4">
            <div class="card-body">
              <h2 class="h4 mb-3">🛠️ Technology</h2>
              <p>Built with modern web technologies:</p>
              <div class="row g-2">
                <div class="col-auto">
                  <span class="badge bg-secondary">Node.js</span>
                </div>
                <div class="col-auto">
                  <span class="badge bg-secondary">Express</span>
                </div>
                <div class="col-auto">
                  <span class="badge bg-secondary">Socket.IO</span>
                </div>
                <div class="col-auto">
                  <span class="badge bg-secondary">TypeScript</span>
                </div>
                <div class="col-auto">
                  <span class="badge bg-secondary">Bootstrap 5</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-4">
          <div class="card sticky-top" style="top: 100px;">
            <div class="card-body text-center">
              <h3 class="h5 mb-3">Ready to Play?</h3>
              <p class="mb-4">Create a game and invite your friends!</p>
              <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg w-100 mb-3">
                🎮 Play Now
              </a>
              <a href="/rules" class="btn btn-outline-primary w-100">
                📖 Read Rules
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="app-footer">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <p>&copy; 2025 Starving Artists Online. Based on the board game by Fairway 3 Games, LLC.</p>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
